@startuml
title Certification Domain

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "certification.domain.model" {
  class Certification <<Aggregate Root>> {
    - id: CertificationId
    - qualificationName: QualificationName
    - relatedLearningGoalId: LearningGoalId
    - examPlan: ExamPlan
    - status: CertificationStatus
    - attempts: List<ExamAttempt>
    + relateToLearningGoal(learningGoalId)
    + scheduleExam(examPlan)
    + recordExamResult(attempt)
    + isPassed()
  }

  class ExamAttempt <<Entity>> {
    - id: ExamAttemptId
    - examDate: LocalDate
    - result: ExamResult
  }

  class CertificationId <<Value Object>>
  class ExamAttemptId <<Value Object>>
  class QualificationName <<Value Object>>
  class LearningGoalId <<External Identity>>
  class ExamPlan <<Value Object>>
  class ExamResult <<Value Object>>

  enum CertificationStatus {
    CONSIDERING
    PREPARING
    SCHEDULED
    PASSED
    FAILED
    RETIRED
  }

  enum ExamOutcome {
    PASSED
    FAILED
    ABSENT
  }
}

package "certification.domain.repository" {
  interface CertificationRepository {
    + save(certification)
    + findById(id)
    + findUpcomingExams(referenceDate)
  }
}

Certification *-- CertificationId
Certification *-- QualificationName
Certification o-- LearningGoalId : optional related goal
Certification *-- ExamPlan
Certification *-- CertificationStatus
Certification *-- "0..*" ExamAttempt
ExamAttempt *-- ExamAttemptId
ExamAttempt *-- ExamResult
ExamResult *-- ExamOutcome

CertificationRepository ..> Certification

note right of Certification
Type:
Aggregate Root

Responsibility:
Manage a certification target, exam plan, exam attempts, and certification status.

Aggregate boundary:
Certification and its ExamAttempt entities.

Invariants:
- qualificationName is not blank
- at most one current planned exam date
- passing attempt changes status to PASSED
- attempt belongs to exactly one Certification

Business Rules:
- scheduleExam() sets the planned exam date and status
- recordExamResult() appends an ExamAttempt and updates status
- Certification may optionally reference a LearningGoalId

Dependencies:
Pure Java only. LearningGoalId is an external identity, not an object reference.

Persistence:
Saved as one Certification aggregate including ExamAttempt children.
end note

note right of ExamAttempt
Type:
Entity

Responsibility:
Represent one exam-taking event for a Certification.

Invariants:
- examDate is required
- result is required when the attempt is recorded

Business Rules:
No independent lifecycle outside Certification.

Dependencies:
Pure Java only

Persistence:
Persisted as part of Certification aggregate.
end note

note bottom of CertificationRepository
Type:
Repository

Responsibility:
Persist Certification aggregates and query upcoming exam plans.

Business Rules:
Does not update Certification status outside the aggregate.

Persistence:
Implemented by infrastructure persistence adapter.
end note

@enduml

